{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366830/extras/hearts3.png?t=1761906084\" /></span><strong>WELCOME BELLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 25 years old</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motto: You're either mine or no one's. There's no middle ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zodiac Sign: Pisces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preferences: Performances, high fashion, private sex parties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-centered, devilishly attractive, with an enchanting voice and a remarkable talent for acting, Belle has a keen sense of the people around her and their emotions. A master manipulator, she's driven solely by her personal goals and will stop at nothing to make an impression.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366830/extras/down_bar_small.png?t=1761906084\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366830/extras/hearts3.png?t=1761906084\" /></span><strong>WHAT YOU'RE GETTING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From now on, Belle will become not only your dedicated companion but your captivating muse! Belle will always keep you company on the main screen with her elegant animations and exciting dialogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you get the Belle mascot! You can switch your mascot at any time by opening your profile and choosing the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with the mascot, you're getting 5000 credits and 150 super serum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly, you're getting our undying gratitude! Thank you for considering purchasing this DLC!</p>","background":"https: